                            "• Intermodal Freight Transport: The movement of cargo in an ISO container or vehicle using multiple modes of transportation (such as rail, ship, "
                            "and motor truck) without direct handling of the freight contents when changing modes, improving speed and reducing cargo damage.\n\n"
                            "• Good Distribution Practice (GDP): Quality assurance standards for the pharmaceutical and life sciences industries, establishing mandatory "
